{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_031tom0233_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_031tom0233_1000_p", "source_sha256": "476d6724f1b4b330b65a8c92c74feda0c6c4778f95e50dc59c14c0335bfa613e", "ja": "（そろそろ、次の定期公演の事を考えないとな。\nうーん、どんな演出にしようか……）", "zh": "（差不多该考虑下一场定期公演的事了。\n嗯——要安排什么样的演出呢……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_031tom0233_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_031tom0233_1001_031tom", "source_sha256": "8673f5a459830b89c7d7ad6279e44fb13ef18fd7e8f34ee61abf44b2d5aeb210", "ja": "う～ん……どちらがいいのでしょう～？\nなかなか難しい問題ですね～。う～ん……。", "zh": "嗯……选哪一个比较好呢～？\n这还真是个不容易解决的问题呢～。嗯……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_031tom0233_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_031tom0233_1002_p", "source_sha256": "d83ac33f8c4c9b49f3c9c4f9346e8708038ffc454d2ea036a4b17f9dd9b22efc", "ja": "あれ？　朋花、何か悩んでるのか？", "zh": "哎？朋花，你在烦恼什么吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_031tom0233_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_031tom0233_1003_031tom", "source_sha256": "dc8f0f687b3789800c9c3d5865954e5d9812dd3dda22a22976a70f44832c7778", "ja": "おや～、{$P$}さん～。\n私の顔色を読むとは、いい心がけですね～♪", "zh": "哎呀～，{$P$}先生～。能察言观色，很不错呢～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_031tom0233_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_031tom0233_1004_031tom", "source_sha256": "ba67338e872469b20d91aae1df4f4f09f302bebdf7ece747d03bbf998c6a7cc2", "ja": "{$P$}さんは、桜とバラ、\nどちらが私に似合うと思いますか～？", "zh": "{$P$}先生觉得，樱花和玫瑰，\n哪一个更适合我呢～？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_031tom0233_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_031tom0233_1005_p", "source_sha256": "aacd090a37d1354693904dbca17816ddd7b927604330fb5faa12ced0d547589d", "ja": "えっ？　桜とバラ？　ええと、そうだな……。\nうーん……？", "zh": "诶？樱花和玫瑰？呃，这个嘛……  \n嗯……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_031tom0233_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_031tom0233_1006_031tom", "source_sha256": "c4f08bcd3531c8a4a2e1bc29452ad6c5b2511bb6a82149840e624948b122a941", "ja": "まったく……パッと答えられないようでは、\n私のプロデューサーとして失格ですよ～。", "zh": "真是的……要是连这个都不能马上回答，\n就不配当我的制作人了哦～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_031tom0233_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_031tom0233_1007_p", "source_sha256": "25741f6668d1d04e4efa72bb887bbd8412cae01ca588c35adfe3ad78702071f8", "ja": "ああ、ごめんごめん。\nでも、どうして急にそんな事を？", "zh": "啊，抱歉抱歉。\n不过，为什么突然问这种事？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_031tom0233_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_031tom0233_1008_031tom", "source_sha256": "d685d1f59124b57a4ccf37aebb443c7e5faca37f4fac3c6c7040d217301a870e", "ja": "子豚ちゃん達がSNSで、どちらが私に似合うかと、\n言い争いをしているようなんです～。", "zh": "小猪仔们似乎正在社交平台上，\n为了哪一个更适合我而争执不休呢～。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_031tom0233_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_031tom0233_1009_031tom", "source_sha256": "527d81f6c3dcc166b76c9a1d432b95126ba13ba82823f9929da13c76755806fb", "ja": "子豚ちゃん達の争いを治めるのは、聖母の務め\nですからね～。私もどちらか、考えていたんですよ～。", "zh": "平息小猪猪们的争斗，正是圣母的职责\n呢～。我也一直在想，究竟哪一种更好呢～。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_031tom0233_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_031tom0233_1010_p", "source_sha256": "08cf5abefe5032f00aab9e13e20388b1924298989c81dad21e88dae4447522eb", "ja": "なるほど……でも、どっちかに決める必要はないん\nじゃないか？　イメージが固まってしまうし。", "zh": "原来如此……不过，没必要非得二选一吧？这样反而会把形象固定下来。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_031tom0233_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_031tom0233_1011_p", "source_sha256": "7b6ad6198398aa6cc99947967a573a6a6fa0217df3fd79bf4794a47f351b2aae", "ja": "むしろ、そこは……朋花なら、どんな花でも似合う！\nって、言いたいところだな。", "zh": "倒不如说，我更想说的是……\n只要是朋花，无论什么花都很相配！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_031tom0233_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_031tom0233_1012_031tom", "source_sha256": "abb3d3e1b91db14815ebf538a7e566b6b6fecdb9d5b2632c6088e05fb9e24995", "ja": "ふむふむ～、悪くない考えですが～……。\nどうやってそれを、子豚ちゃん達に示すんですか～？", "zh": "嗯嗯～，这个想法倒也不错～……不过，要怎么向小猪们证明这一点呢～？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_031tom0233_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_031tom0233_1013_p", "source_sha256": "c545712769f2644399032ff1a5288cd2c58806989a1f483ea81c73adc455726b", "ja": "うーん、そうだな……あっ！　それなら次の公演で、\n色々な花を使った演出をするのはどうだろう？", "zh": "嗯——，是啊……啊！那样的话，下次公演时，\n用各种各样的花来进行演出怎么样？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_031tom0233_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_031tom0233_1014_p", "source_sha256": "2fa914ab4faf40d5b96dc2031a2a98eb1136b0bbb8fec2c5bec4a50d796b2aea", "ja": "ステージも華やかになるし、いいと思うんだけど。\n準備は大変そうだけど、まあ何とかできると思う。", "zh": "舞台也会变得绚丽多彩，我觉得挺不错的。\n准备起来似乎会很辛苦，不过应该总能想办法完成的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_031tom0233_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_031tom0233_1015_031tom", "source_sha256": "e3578a3da97735180447487e3c8282acda303115dcde2bfe99e717ac6a9ea59b", "ja": "……。\nうふふっ♪　その言葉を待っていましたよ～。", "zh": "……。\n呵呵♪　我可一直在等您这句话呢～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_031tom0233_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_031tom0233_1016_p", "source_sha256": "5b344ebaf95b2fe1eaff14e63179221760839d82b3353f7419ce326dc848e78d", "ja": "えっ？　待っていた……？", "zh": "诶？您一直在等这个……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_031tom0233_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_031tom0233_1017_031tom", "source_sha256": "cecdd29cabff036d59d13f49c59417e791bf61d703695e865b8ee9335fa286f6", "ja": "少し、試させていただきました～。\nステージで証明するのが、一番ですからね～。うふふ♪", "zh": "我稍微试探了您一下呢～。\n毕竟在舞台上证明，才是最好的办法呀～。呵呵♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_031tom0233_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_031tom0233_1018_p", "source_sha256": "ee1dd12e3e8ac94fd9f8f99d7ec31edaa16e73fab3d06f0eeddf77d521a91686", "ja": "まさか……最初から俺を誘導していたのか！？\n朋花……！", "zh": "难道说……从一开始你就在引导我吗！？\n朋花……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_031tom0233_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_031tom0233_1019_031tom", "source_sha256": "c384e82d976454229ba4db7172030f1cebc8e9ac5346d4ffb20ccc50439bccb2", "ja": "ふふっ♪　自分の言葉には責任を持ってくださいね～。\n私も子豚ちゃん達も、楽しみにしていますよ～♪", "zh": "呵呵♪ 要对自己说过的话负责哦～  \n我和小猪仔们都很期待呢～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_031tom0233_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_031tom0233_1020_p", "source_sha256": "fb41522017f3734156a03c340001a364e8206517653e4f66979e09c13939bde7", "ja": "（まさか、朋花の手のひらで転がされていたとは……。\nまあいいや。次の公演も楽しみだな！）", "zh": "（没想到竟然一直被朋花玩弄于股掌之间……\n不过也无所谓了。真期待下一场公演啊！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
